+   wrong answers. The rule stands: classify by reason. The instrument is replaced by the shared deterministic
+   `coherence_gate`. It first takes **paired byte-identity against a named anchor**, then ground-truth answer
+   checks plus a length-aware `degeneracy.v2` that **refuses synthetic token ids**, then a paired judge for
+   residual divergences. Full texts and token ids are stored, so any verdict can be replayed. No INF-70 keep,
+   reject or promotion rested on a uniq-only SALAD: those decisions stand on their paired byte-identity.
 
